7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Mizuki. Logic prevails. I will analyze every statement carefully.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hi, I'm Minato. I just want everyone to be friends.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Jonathan. I listen to the quiet spaces between words.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,Minato's friendliness is a variable. I will monitor it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. Friendliness can mask intent. We need concrete evidence.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,Indeed. I find Minato's lack of analysis suspicious.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minato,,I don't know much about this game yet. I'm learning.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Your hesitation is noted. It is a human trait.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Jonathan, your comment on Minato was sharp. Why?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,Jonathan is observing. It is a valid strategy.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Misaki. Observation is key to survival.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minato,,I feel a bit left out. Can we be nicer?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am merely cataloging reactions. No malice intended.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,The night will reveal truths. I will be ready.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Let us rest. Efficiency requires clarity.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
